_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNFKKGyia2-uGL3R73sYvc0IkyfgBu8jMwTjUyhsCIzNQ&oe=6ACA67C1"}, {"file_name": "PDPScreenshotEvil3.png", "id": "850984144565356", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499314623_850984151232022_3971040032038631324_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=7VRHgh3WFlEQ7kNvwHdKbeu&_nc_oc=AdoWL7wnqN73lA11mLctDunead7UEHuBWrgNDVMycx9k0vY0-36IICmxAeZqSupTNKA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQN8XnUD9Ov5ce0jaeYhgZLZwQXUt_KkMGw2ZPDYjVzW4g&oe=6ACA65F6"}, {"file_name": "PDPScreenshot2 (1).png", "id": "1298106582529645", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499622916_1298106585862978_4274021957769645456_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Tyx50t3OX_QQ7kNvwGoR86J&_nc_oc=AdpRhTQRBx_m2NYM1nRAgjXoLwrSzLNeauXjcyEn2xksjjrzgL-JTBZN8D2oEnTU3kA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNe9vMxy2O4ZJfUjfjeFCB58mAkPu7QTNSttzKTl5NPRA&oe=6ACA5445"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "HtG Divine Voices September 26 Landscape 00.png", "id": "1955805235089281", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823259_1955805238422614_7434143649211774314_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=kNaIwKddIxkQ7kNvwEh1r0v&_nc_oc=AdrlfTCY8pL1ct9cCSNuM7dX04JzMzwyM9J44oVWE9YCToHH3h361TBKazj8TQm-L_I&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQOcyCPWAlyrcPHb-1pFYfXeVChTQariO3usHM9g40OGJA&oe=6ACA70EE"}, "display_name": "How to God", "keywords": ["creature", "quests", "crafting", "simulation", "god"], "long_description": "# What Kind of God Will You Be?\n\n\ud83d\udd14 **DIVINE VOICES UPDATE** \ud83d\udd14 You asked, we answered! We\u2019ve updated the voices of Athena, Bastet, Cernunnos, Poseidon, and various NPCs with real voices from real voice actors. Let us know what you think!\n{2710262969424052}\n\n**How to God** is a god simulation game where you\u2019ll build villages, raise a creature, discover alchemy, battle enemy gods, unlock new powers, and make the ultimate choice between good and evil. No judgement from us, of course - only you can choose How to God.\n\n# Harness Alchemy\nCombine elements to make something new! Like fire + fire = big fire!\n{1064190926351656}\n\n# Choose your creature\nTrain your mighty creature to do whatever you please: kick villagers, eat villagers\u2026 or, something nice like dance \ud83d\ude02\n{1805193534239505}\n\n# Construct villages\nBuild stuff like homes, farms, mines and discover blueprints to make even more!\n{1046203311364976}\n\n# Unlock godly abilities\nChoose different powers to min max your way to the top, but beware godling - not all powers can be unlocked in a single save.\n{1621013422943899}\n\nWield your godly might, shape the world with your choices, and learn **How to God**.\n{1037328029315321}", "short_description": "How to God is an immersive VR god simulation game allowing you to step into the divine sandals of a new god, growing in power as you progress. Build up your villages, raise a unique creature, battle rival deities and command the elements to unlock new powers. Will you be a wise and benevolent leader, or a vengeful beast of destruction? Only you can choose How To God. Make your choice now on Meta Quest 2, 3, and 3S."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "HtG Group Picture October 2026 03-1 (1).png", "id": "3268314146711258", "image_type": "APP_IMG_MARKDOWN_INLINE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491828008_3268314153377924_5605896239508267855_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=e9GZzQpRbYcQ7kNvwGX2Lq_&_nc_oc=AdoMmsfazFlVqBpDNmYkBNJeF9JyZ_3WnAPU29PSvPGcCzIaQuPikn54BcmfYZRUX70&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMvs8S-hdMOMtOopE5cLlGpYLfFi-mZnG5P7g5Y1vqnlw&oe=6ACA74BD"}]}, "id": "2210780416154572", "locale": "en_GB", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "How to God", "keywords": ["creature", "quests", "crafting", "simulation", "god"], "long_description": "# What Kind of God Will You Be?\n\n\ud83d\udd14 **DIVINE VOICES UPDATE** \ud83d\udd14 You asked, we answered! We\u2019ve updated the voices of Athena, Bastet, Cernunnos, Poseidon, and various NPCs with real voices from real voice actors. Let us know what you think!\n{2926680264363971}\n\n**How to God** is a god simulation game where you\u2019ll build villages, raise a creature, discover alchemy, battle enemy gods, unlock new powers, and make the ultimate choice between good and evil. No judgement from us, of course - only you can choose How to God.\n\n# Harness Alchemy\nCombine elements to make something new! Like fire + fire = big fire!\n{1997608174271935}\n\n# Choose your creature\nTrain your creature to kick, eat, shake, dance, and more!\n{1761065595216944}\n\n# Construct villages\nBuild homes, farms, mines and discover blueprints.\n{1818565439586701}\n\n# Unlock godly abilities\nChoose different powers to min max your way to the top, but beware - not all powers can be unlocked in a single play through!\n{1394575526203040}\n\nWield your godly might, shape the world with your choices, and learn **How to God**.\n{3268314146711258}", "short_description": "How to God is an immersive VR god simulation game allowing you to step into the divine sandals of a new god, growing in power as you progress. Build up your villages, raise a unique creature, battle rival deities and command the elements to unlock new powers. Will you be a wise and benevolent leader, or a vengeful beast of destruction? Only you can choose How To God. Make your choice now on Meta Quest 2, 3, and 3S."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "HtG Group Picture October 2026 03-1 (1).png", "id": "3182276625305505", "image_type": "APP_IMG_MARKDOWN_INLINE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823746_3182276631972171_8018810520676976186_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=jYqe9tTwH24Q7kNvwFKHjk9&_nc_oc=AdrtuPpIq2-sUnGk9L34MwTZ1AT0S3k8Qh3-vS44tZXqS883KnjNiJxla2tAaiLPPNk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQN6O9mKjuHOFivxqNZ5XpgpfCPxFDuszrm1Nyx5296j-w&oe=6ACA5D8E"}]}, "id": "1656778405869446", "locale": "de_DE", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "How to God", "keywords": ["gott", "quests", "kreaturen", "crafting", "simulation"], "long_description": "# Was f\u00fcr ein Gott wirst du sein?\n\n\ud83d\udd14 **G\u00d6TTERSTIMMEN UPDATE**\ud83d\udd14 Ihr habt gefragt, wir haben geantwortet! Wir haben die Stimmen von Athena, Bastet, Cernunnos, Poseidon sowie diversen NPCs durch echte Stimmen professioneller Sprecher ersetzt. Lasst uns wissen, was ihr davon haltet!\n{1625506262488943}\n\nIn **How to God**, einem Sandbox-Gott-Simulationsspiel, bestimmst du allein, wie du deine Welt gestaltest. Befehlige deine Anh\u00e4nger, experimentiere mit Alchemie, erf\u00fclle Questreihen, stelle dich gewaltigen Herausforderungen und entscheide dich zwischen Gut und B\u00f6se. Nat\u00fcrlich urteilen wir nicht \u2013 du entscheidest \u201cHow to God\u201d.\n\n\n# W\u00e4hle deine Kreatur\nErschaffe eine m\u00e4chtige Kreatur, die deinen Befehlen gehorcht! Trainiere sie mit Belohnungen oder Bestrafungen und sieh zu, wie sie zu einem wilden und m\u00e4chtigen Wesen heranw\u00e4chst.\n{2174672563461946}\n\n# Nutze Alchemie\nKombiniere Materialien, um etwas Neues zu schaffen \u2013 versuche es auch mit Dorfbewohnern!\n{1081301784494187}\n\n# Baue D\u00f6rfer\nBaue alles von bescheidenen H\u00e4usern bis hin zu heiligen Schreinen und mehr.\n{2111590773085071}\n\n# Schalte g\u00f6ttliche F\u00e4higkeiten frei\nW\u00e4hle aus vielen verschiedenen geheimnisvollen Kr\u00e4ften und entfessle deine ganz eigene g\u00f6ttliche Macht!\n{3006365389712844}\n\nSetze deine g\u00f6ttliche Macht ein, gestalte die Welt mit deinen Entscheidungen und lerne **\u201cHow to God\u201d**.\n{3182276625305505}", "short_description": "How to God ist ein immersives VR-G\u00f6ttersimulationsspiel, in dem du in die g\u00f6ttlichen Sandalen eines Anf\u00e4ngergottes schl\u00fcpfst. Baue deine D\u00f6rfer auf, ziehe eine einzigartige Kreatur auf, bek\u00e4mpfe rivalisierende Gottheiten und befehlige die Elemente, um neue Kr\u00e4fte freizusetzen. Wirst du ein weiser und g\u00fctiger Anf\u00fchrer oder ein rachs\u00fcchtiges Unget\u00fcm sein? Du entscheidest selbst \u201cHow To God\u201d. Triff deine Wahl jetzt auf Meta Quest 2, 3 und 3S."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "HtG Group Picture October 2026 03-1 (1).png", "id": "1417176860385517", "image_type": "APP_IMG_MARKDOWN_INLINE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823746_1417176867052183_4174741835059134672_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Lsi2rPMcOV0Q7kNvwElIsP2&_nc_oc=AdraW5yFFSkBWd-hJkZWLy7KDwpCNirwaHKsv2w3vGW0jaIpf6OqxnvUJzTBJUDQi84&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQN5M1PzM_hHYBfKflvKWLiCvMlSjW12a6yJcIcQi7wFmA&oe=6ACA44A9"}]}, "id": "1405356294509198", "locale": "ko_KR", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "How to God", "keywords": ["\uc2e0", "\ud018\uc2a4\ud2b8", "\uc0dd\ubb3c", "\uc81c\uc791", "\uc2dc\ubbac\ub808\uc774\uc158"], "long_description": "# \uc5b4\ub5a4 \uc2e0\uc774 \ub420 \uac83\uc778\uac00?\n\n\ud83d\udd14 **\u2018\ub514\ubc14\uc778 \ubcf4\uc774\uc2a4\u2019 \uc5c5\ub370\uc774\ud2b8** \ud83d\udd14 \uc5ec\ub7ec\ubd84\uc758 \uc694\uccad\uc5d0 \ubd80\uc751\ud558\uc5ec, \uc544\ud14c\ub098, \ubc14\uc2a4\ud14c\ud2b8, \ucf00\ub974\ub204\ub178\uc2a4, \ud3ec\uc138\uc774\ub3c8 \ubc0f \ub2e4\uc591\ud55c NPC\uc758 \ubaa9\uc18c\ub9ac\ub97c \uc2e4\uc81c \uc131\uc6b0\ub4e4\uc758 \ubaa9\uc18c\ub9ac\ub85c \uc5c5\ub370\uc774\ud2b8\ud588\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4. \uc5ec\ub7ec\ubd84\uc758 \uc758\uacac\uc744 \uc54c\ub824\uc8fc\uc138\uc694!\n{1031922036515974}\n\n\uc0cc\ub4dc\ubc15\uc2a4 \uc2e0 \uc2dc\ubbac\ub808\uc774\uc158 \uac8c\uc784 **\u00abHow to God\u00bb** \uc5d0\uc11c \uc624\uc9c1 \ub2f9\uc2e0\ub9cc\uc774 \uc138\uc0c1\uc744 \uc5b4\ub5bb\uac8c \ub9cc\ub4e4\uc9c0 \uacb0\uc815\ud569\ub2c8\ub2e4. \uc2e0\ub3c4\ub4e4\uc744 \uc9c0\ud718\ud558\uace0, \uc5f0\uae08\uc220\uc744 \uc2e4\ud5d8\ud558\uba70, \ud018\uc2a4\ud2b8\ub97c \uc644\uc218\ud558\uace0, \uc804\ub2a5\ud55c \ub3c4\uc804\uc5d0 \ub9de\uc11c\uba70 \uc120\uacfc \uc545 \uc0ac\uc774\uc5d0\uc11c \uc120\ud0dd\ud558\uc138\uc694. \ubb3c\ub860 \uc800\ud76c\ub294 \ud310\ub2e8\ud558\uc9c0 \uc54a\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4. \uc624\uc9c1 \ub2f9\uc2e0\ub9cc\uc774 \u00abHow to God\u00bb\uc744 \uc120\ud0dd\ud560 \uc218 \uc788\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4.\n\n# \ub2f9\uc2e0\uc758 \ucc3d\uc870\ubb3c\uc744 \uc120\ud0dd\ud558\uc138\uc694\n\n\ub2f9\uc2e0\uc758 \uba85\ub839\uc744 \uc218\ud589\ud560 \uac15\ub825\ud55c \ucc3d\uc870\ubb3c\uc744 \uc18c\ud658\ud558\uc138\uc694! \ubcf4\uc0c1\uc774\ub098 \ucc98\ubc8c\ub85c \ud6c8\ub828\uc2dc\ud0a4\uace0, \uadf8\uac83\uc774 \uc0ac\ub098\uc6b0\uba74\uc11c\ub3c4 \uac15\ub825\ud55c \uc874\uc7ac\ub85c \uc131\uc7a5\ud558\ub294 \ubaa8\uc2b5\uc744 \uc9c0\ucf1c\ubcf4\uc138\uc694.\n{3585203621641964}\n\n# \uc5f0\uae08\uc220 \ud65c\uc6a9\ud558\uae30\n\n\uc7ac\ub8cc\ub4e4\uc744 \uc870\ud569\ud558\uc5ec \uc0c8\ub85c\uc6b4 \uac83\uc744 \ucc3d\uc870\ud558\uc138\uc694 - \ub9c8\uc744 \uc8fc\ubbfc\ub4e4\uc5d0\uac8c\ub3c4 \uc2dc\ub3c4\ud574 \ubcf4\uc138\uc694!\n{3017527048639462}\n\n# \ub9c8\uc744 \uac74\uc124\n\n\uc18c\ubc15\ud55c \uc9d1\ubd80\ud130 \uc2e0\uc131\ud55c \uc2e0\uc804\uae4c\uc9c0 \ubaa8\ub4e0 \uac83\uc744 \uac74\uc124\ud558\uc138\uc694.\n{28203785065980330}\n\n# \uc2e0\uc758 \ub2a5\ub825 \ud574\uae08\n\n\ub2e4\uc591\ud55c \uc2e0\ube44\ud55c \ud798 \uc911\uc5d0\uc11c \uc120\ud0dd\ud558\uace0, \ub2f9\uc2e0\ub9cc\uc758 \ub3c5\ud2b9\ud55c \uc2e0\uc758 \uc704\ub825\uc744 \ubc1c\ud718\ud558\uc138\uc694!\n{1412619610963893}\n\n\uc2e0\uc758 \ud798\uc744 \ud718\ub450\ub974\uace0, \uc120\ud0dd\uc73c\ub85c \uc138\uc0c1\uc744 \ub9cc\ub4e4\uc5b4\uac00\uba70, **<<How to God>>** \ub97c \ubc30\uc6cc\ub77c.\n{1417176860385517}", "short_description": "\u00abHow to God\u00bb\uc740 \ucd08\ubcf4 \uc2e0\uc758 \uc785\uc7a5\uc774 \ub418\uc5b4 \uc2e0\uc758 \uc2e0\ubc1c\uc744 \uc2e0\uc5b4\ubcf4\ub294 \ubab0\uc785\ud615 VR \uc2e0 \uc2dc\ubbac\ub808\uc774\uc158 \uac8c\uc784\uc785\ub2c8\ub2e4. \ub9c8\uc744\uc744 \uac74\uc124\ud558\uace0, \ub3c5\ud2b9\ud55c \uc0dd\ubb3c\uc744 \ud0a4\uc6b0\uba70, \ub77c\uc774\ubc8c \uc2e0\ub4e4\uacfc \uc2f8\uc6b0\uace0, \uc6d0\uc18c\ub97c \uc9c0\ubc30\ud558\uc5ec \uc0c8\ub85c\uc6b4 \ud798\uc744 \ud574\uae08\ud558\uc138\uc694. \ud604\uba85\ud558\uace0 \uc790\ube44\ub85c\uc6b4 \uc9c0\ub3c4\uc790\uac00 \ub420 \uac83\uc778\uac00, \ubcf5\uc218\uc2ec\uc5d0 \ubd88\ud0c0\ub294 \ud30c\uad34\uc758 \uad34\ubb3c\uc774 \ub420 \uac83\uc778\uac00? \uc624\uc9c1 \ub2f9\uc2e0\ub9cc\uc774 \u00abHow to God\u00bb\uc744 \uc120\ud0dd\ud560 \uc218 \uc788\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4. \uc9c0\uae08 Meta Quest 2, 3, 3S\uc5d0\uc11c \uc120\ud0dd\ud558\uc138\uc694."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "HtG Group Picture October 2026 03-1 (1).png", "id": "1810520360149458", "image_type": "APP_IMG_MARKDOWN_INLINE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823366_1810520363482791_7676753977467844889_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=z1ndLrxLVTIQ7kNvwG5dnP6&_nc_oc=AdqbXuUPddMKZR51N9DcDt7PUsOXmTs_TH41ZHKRJrjS-KfYlxeQpaLRzOpKEcBsA0Q&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQOZmEzobH9Z1bFzs6M5-JnSm8M3xUVwFhYyulTqB-xQbQ&oe=6ACA741F"}]}, "id": "1367197659815129", "locale": "ja_JP", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "How to God", "keywords": ["\u795e", "\u30af\u30a8\u30b9\u30c8", "\u30af\u30ea\u30fc\u30c1\u30e3\u30fc", "\u30af\u30e9\u30d5\u30c8", "\u30b7\u30df\u30e5\u30ec\u30fc\u30b7\u30e7\u30f3"], "long_description": "# \u3069\u3093\u306a\u795e\u306b\u306a\u308b\uff1f\n\n\ud83d\udd14 **\u300eDIVINE VOICES\u300f\u30a2\u30c3\u30d7\u30c7\u30fc\u30c8** \ud83d\udd14 \u7686\u69d8\u304b\u3089\u306e\u3054\u8981\u671b\u306b\u304a\u5fdc\u3048\u3057\u3066\uff01\u30a2\u30c6\u30ca\u3001\u30d0\u30b9\u30c6\u30c8\u3001\u30b1\u30eb\u30cc\u30ce\u30b9\u3001\u30dd\u30bb\u30a4\u30c9\u30f3\u3001\u305d\u3057\u3066\u3055\u307e\u3056\u307e\u306aNPC\u306e\u30dc\u30a4\u30b9\u3092\u3001\u672c\u7269\u306e\u58f0\u512a\u306b\u3088\u308b\u5b9f\u969b\u306e\u58f0\u306b\u66f4\u65b0\u3057\u307e\u3057\u305f\u3002\u305c\u3072\u3054\u611f\u60f3\u3092\u304a\u805e\u304b\u305b\u304f\u3060\u3055\u3044\uff01\n{1379376814316984}\n\n\u30b5\u30f3\u30c9\u30dc\u30c3\u30af\u30b9\u578b\u795e\u30b7\u30df\u30e5\u30ec\u30fc\u30b7\u30e7\u30f3\u30b2\u30fc\u30e0 **<<How to God>>** \u3067\u306f\u3001\u4e16\u754c\u306e\u5f62\u3092\u3042\u306a\u305f\u81ea\u8eab\u304c\u6c7a\u5b9a\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002\u4fe1\u8005\u3092\u7d71\u7387\u3057\u3001\u932c\u91d1\u8853\u3092\u99c6\u4f7f\u3057\u3001\u30af\u30a8\u30b9\u30c8\u3092\u9042\u884c\u3057\u3001\u5727\u5012\u7684\u306a\u8a66\u7df4\u306b\u7acb\u3061\u5411\u304b\u3044\u3001\u5584\u60aa\u306e\u9078\u629e\u3092\u8feb\u3089\u308c\u307e\u3059\u3002\u3082\u3061\u308d\u3093\u6211\u3005\u306f\u88c1\u304d\u307e\u305b\u3093\u2014\u2014 <<How to God>> \u306e\u9053\u3092\u9078\u3076\u306e\u306f\u3042\u306a\u305f\u3060\u3051\u3067\u3059\u3002\n\n# \u3042\u306a\u305f\u306e\u5275\u9020\u7269\u3092\u9078\u3073\u306a\u3055\u3044\n\n\u3042\u306a\u305f\u306e\u547d\u4ee4\u306b\u5f93\u3046\u5f37\u5927\u306a\u5275\u9020\u7269\u3092\u751f\u307f\u51fa\u305b\uff01\u5831\u916c\u3084\u7f70\u3067\u8a13\u7df4\u3057\u3001\u305d\u308c\u304c\u731b\u3005\u3057\u304f\u5f37\u529b\u306a\u5b58\u5728\u3078\u3068\u6210\u9577\u3059\u308b\u59ff\u3092\u898b\u5c4a\u3051\u3088\u3002\n{1053620007555791}\n\n# \u932c\u91d1\u8853\u306e\u638c\u63e1\n\n\u7d20\u6750\u3092\u7d44\u307f\u5408\u308f\u305b\u3066\u65b0\u305f\u306a\u3082\u306e\u3092\u5275\u9020\u305b\u3088\u2014\u2014\u6751\u4eba\u305f\u3061\u306b\u3082\u8a66\u3057\u3066\u307f\u3088\u3046\uff01\n{1700737597658662}\n\n# \u6751\u3092\u5efa\u8a2d\u305b\u3088\n\n\u8cea\u7d20\u306a\u5bb6\u5c4b\u304b\u3089\u795e\u8056\u306a\u795e\u793e\u307e\u3067\u3001\u3042\u3089\u3086\u308b\u5efa\u9020\u7269\u3092\u5efa\u3066\u4e0a\u3052\u3088\u3046\u3002\n{2393731057826181}\n\n\n# \u795e\u3005\u306e\u80fd\u529b\u3092\u89e3\u304d\u653e\u3066\n\n\u6570\u591a\u304f\u306e\u795e\u79d8\u7684\u306a\u529b\u304b\u3089\u9078\u3073\u3001\u3042\u306a\u305f\u3060\u3051\u306e\u795e\u3005\u306e\u5a01\u529b\u3092\u89e3\u304d\u653e\u3066\uff01\n{1086155473969870}\n\n\u795e\u3005\u306e\u529b\u3092\u632f\u308b\u3044\u9078\u629e\u3067\u4e16\u754c\u3092\u5909\u3048\u3088\u3046 **<<How to God>>** \u3092\u5b66\u3079\u3002\n{1810520360149458}", "short_description": "<<How to God>>\u306f\u6ca1\u5165\u578bVR\u795e\u30b7\u30df\u30e5\u30ec\u30fc\u30b7\u30e7\u30f3\u30b2\u30fc\u30e0\u3002\u521d\u5fc3\u8005\u306e\u795e\u306e\u7acb\u5834\u3067\u4e16\u754c\u3092\u5275\u9020\u3057\u3088\u3046\u3002\u6751\u3092\u5efa\u8a2d\u3057\u3001\u72ec\u81ea\u306e\u751f\u7269\u3092\u80b2\u3066\u3001\u30e9\u30a4\u30d0\u30eb\u795e\u3005\u3068\u6226\u3044\u3001\u5143\u7d20\u3092\u64cd\u3063\u3066\u65b0\u305f\u306a\u529b\u3092\u89e3\u304d\u653e\u3066\u3002\u3042\u306a\u305f\u306f\u8ce2\u660e\u3067\u6148\u60b2\u6df1\u3044\u6307\u5c0e\u8005\u3068\u306a\u308b\u304b\u3001\u5fa9\u8b90\u306b\u71c3\u3048\u308b\u7834\u58ca\u306e\u5316\u8eab\u3068\u306a\u308b\u304b\uff1f<<How To God>>\u306e\u9053\u306f\u3042\u306a\u305f\u6b21\u7b2c\u3002Meta Quest 2\u30013\u30013S\u3067\u4eca\u3059\u3050\u9078\u629e\u3092\u3002"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "HtG Group Picture October 2026 03-1 (1).png", "id": "1303309515157115", "image_type": "APP_IMG_MARKDOWN_INLINE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823910_1303309525157114_3877608800056738471_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Eh6njSG1T54Q7kNvwE9i9xD&_nc_oc=Adrxlnji1VDnxDaAc9M1LK9zTHBJ2IizDnTVEzei-dudpiieRNluJOXMJbrUGCf1U2Q&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPnshUPFYKkOoUHZ8LaaX378HyRBXq5Y3pL4jql6cWMyQ&oe=6ACA52A9"}]}, "id": "1096481439803061", "locale": "es_LA", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "How to God", "keywords": ["dios", "misiones", "criaturas", "oficios", "simulaci\u00f3n"], "long_description": "# \u00bfQu\u00e9 tipo de dios ser\u00e1s?\n\n\ud83d\udd14 **ACTUALIZACI\u00d3N DIVINE VOICES** \ud83d\udd14 Ustedes pidieron, nosotros respondemos! Actualizamos las voces de Athena, Bastet, Cernunnos, Poseidon y varios NPCs con voces reales de actores de voz reales. D\u00e9janos saber que opinas!\n{1580937150495850}\n\nEn **How to God**, un juego de simulaci\u00f3n de dios tipo sandbox, solo tu eliges c\u00f3mo moldear tu mundo. Domina tus seguidores, experimenta con alquimia, completa misiones, confronta todo tipo desaf\u00edos divinos, y elige entre el bien y el mal. Nosotros no juzgamos, solo tu puedes elegir que tipo de dios ser en How to God.\n\n# Elige tu criatura\n\u00a1Crea una criatura poderosa que cumpla tus \u00f3rdenes! Entr\u00e9nala con recompensas o castigos, y observa c\u00f3mo se convierte en una fuerza feroz y poderosa.\n{1730306058078065}\n\n# Utiliza la alquimia\nCombina elementos para crear algo nuevo. \u00a1Intentalo con aldeanos tambi\u00e9n! \n{1595214958724772}\n\n# Construye aldeas\nConstruye todo, desde simples casas hasta santuarios sagrados \u00a1y m\u00e1s!\n{1333428491989440}\n\n# Desbloquea habilidades divinas\nElige entre una gran variedad de poderes arcanos y desata tu propio poder.\n{1132844022740556}\n\nUtiliza tu poder divino, moldea el mundo con tus decisiones y aprende a ser dios en **How to God**.\n{1303309515157115}", "short_description": "How to God es un juego inmersivo (RV) de simulaci\u00f3n que te permite ponerte en la piel de un dios principiante. Re-construye tus aldeas, educa una criatura \u00fanica, lucha contra deidades rivales y domina los elementos para desbloquear nuevos poderes. \u00bfSer\u00e1s un l\u00edder sabio y ben\u00e9volo o una bestia vengativa y destructora? Solo t\u00fa puedes elegir qu\u00e9 tipo de dios ser en How to God. Elige ahora en Meta Quest 2, 3 y 3S."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "HtG Group Picture October 2026 03-1 (1).png", "id": "1440430501603882", "image_type": "APP_IMG_MARKDOWN_INLINE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823296_1440430504937215_8685936910299894590_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=HjdKZBQGfl0Q7kNvwE8f4f2&_nc_oc=AdqEomnhayN9lyQJJr4e4URJmRtviFIZGSCqZFep5_JWyeYuMXcSypXY06vQk8Y59b8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNIFLDjPyY43E_3TZ7sl-cly-CvWGz8ba8GYi8u87WDDA&oe=6ACA5CBF"}]}, "id": "1085306737580655", "locale": "es_ES", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "How to God", "keywords": ["dios", "misiones", "criaturas", "oficios", "simulaci\u00f3n"], "long_description": "# \u00bfQu\u00e9 tipo de dios ser\u00e1s?\n\n\ud83d\udd14 **ACTUALIZACI\u00d3N DIVINE VOICES** \ud83d\udd14 Ustedes pidieron, nosotros respondemos! Actualizamos las voces de Athena, Bastet, Cernunnos, Poseidon y varios NPCs con voces reales de actores de voz reales. D\u00e9janos saber que opinas!\n{2319360502143905}\n\nEn **How to God**, un juego de simulaci\u00f3n de dios tipo sandbox, solo tu eliges c\u00f3mo moldear tu mundo. Domina tus seguidores, experimenta con alquimia, completa misiones, confronta todo tipo desaf\u00edos divinos, y elige entre el bien y el mal. Nosotros no juzgamos, solo tu puedes elegir que tipo de dios ser en How to God.\n\n# Elige tu criatura\n\u00a1Crea una criatura poderosa que cumpla tus \u00f3rdenes! Entr\u00e9nala con recompensas o castigos, y observa c\u00f3mo se convierte en una fuerza feroz y poderosa.\n{1403984061700148}\n\n# Utiliza la alquimia\nCombina elementos para crear algo nuevo. \u00a1Intentalo con aldeanos tambi\u00e9n! \n{1364663129087058}\n\n# Construye aldeas\nConstruye todo, desde simples casas hasta santuarios sagrados \u00a1y m\u00e1s!\n{1062815590069249}\n\n# Desbloquea habilidades divinas\nElige entre una gran variedad de poderes arcanos y desata tu propio poder.\n{931285016706244}\n\nUtiliza tu poder divino, moldea el mundo con tus decisiones y aprende a ser dios en **How to God**.\n{1440430501603882}", "short_description": "How to God es un juego inmersivo (RV) de simulaci\u00f3n que te permite ponerte en la piel de un dios principiante. Re-construye tus aldeas, educa una criatura \u00fanica, lucha contra deidades rivales y domina los elementos para desbloquear nuevos poderes. \u00bfSer\u00e1s un l\u00edder sabio y ben\u00e9volo o una bestia vengativa y destructora? Solo t\u00fa puedes elegir qu\u00e9 tipo de dios ser en How to God. Elige ahora en Meta Quest 2, 3 y 3S."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "HtG Group Picture October 2026 03-1 (1).png", "id": "2490149208145360", "image_type": "APP_IMG_MARKDOWN_INLINE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823351_2490149211478693_1345172806008059871_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=thRUzeSZWQAQ7kNvwGGkgNw&_nc_oc=AdqFxR_twuhPgzwMi-7b8c6s1f83QtdUTiLjsVv8WxZ50k-1yVg5dMJtCrGBlsz9H54&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQO075jaB1tkHna-d3yi3esAkIq9NYvxQZiVZysUJY5JYA&oe=6ACA6CD9"}]}, "id": "1075486481942445", "locale": "fr_FR", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "How to God", "keywords": ["dieu", "qu\u00eates", "cr\u00e9atures", "artisanat", "simulation"], "long_description": "# Quel genre de dieu serez-vous ?\n\n\ud83d\udd14 **MISE \u00c0 JOUR DES VOIX DIVINES** \ud83d\udd14 Nous avons mis \u00e0 jour les voix d'Ath\u00e9na, de Bastet, de Cernunnos, de Pos\u00e9idon et de divers PNJ en les rempla\u00e7ant par de v\u00e9ritables voix d'acteurs de doublage.\n{1658837619266693}\n\nDans **How to God**, un jeu de simulation de dieu en mode bac \u00e0 sable, vous seul choisissez comment fa\u00e7onner votre monde. Commandez vos disciples, exp\u00e9rimentez l'alchimie, accomplissez des qu\u00eates, affrontez des d\u00e9fis redoutables et faites le choix entre le bien et le mal. Nous ne vous jugerons pas, bien s\u00fbr : vous seul pouvez choisir \u00abHow to God \u00bb.\n\n# Choisissez votre cr\u00e9ature\n\nFaites appara\u00eetre une cr\u00e9ature puissante pour accomplir votre volont\u00e9 ! Entra\u00eenez-la \u00e0 l'aide de r\u00e9compenses ou de punitions, puis regardez-la devenir une force f\u00e9roce et puissante.\n{1569627737406914}\n\n# Ma\u00eetrisez l'alchimie\n\nCombinez des mat\u00e9riaux pour cr\u00e9er quelque chose de nouveau. Essayez \u00e9galement avec les villageois !\n{1588134472847383}\n\n# Construisez des villages\nConstruisez tout, des maisons modestes aux sanctuaires sacr\u00e9s, et bien plus encore.\n{28099731476362046}\n\n# D\u00e9bloquez des capacit\u00e9s divines\nChoisissez parmi de nombreux pouvoirs myst\u00e9rieux et lib\u00e9rez votre propre puissance divine unique !\n{1058669770484965}\n\nExercez votre puissance divine, fa\u00e7onnez le monde avec vos choix et apprenez \u00e0 **\u00abHow to God \u00bb**.\n\n\n{2490149208145360}", "short_description": "How to God est un jeu immersif de simulation divine en r\u00e9alit\u00e9 virtuelle qui vous permet d'endosser le r\u00f4le d'un dieu d\u00e9butant. Construisez vos villages, \u00e9levez une cr\u00e9ature unique, affrontez des divinit\u00e9s rivales et commandez les \u00e9l\u00e9ments pour d\u00e9bloquer de nouveaux pouvoirs. Serez-vous un leader sage et bienveillant, ou une b\u00eate vengeresse et destructrice ? Vous seul pouvez choisir dans How To God. Faites votre choix d\u00e8s maintenant sur Meta Quest 2, 3 et 3S."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.thoughtfish.de/htg-privacy-policy/", "developer